  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills based gender sensitive market relevant economic empowerment programmes for youth contribute to a smooth transition phase.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO support aims to provide crisis-affected communities with an improved ability to manage local risks and shocks for increased resilience and self-reliance. 
 The ILO will contribute to i) employment creation opportunities and income generation, ii) provide vocational skills and Business Development Services training to women and young technicians using a competency-based curriculum; iii) contribute to increasing access to market-driven quality vocational education for those who dropped out of schools.</narrative>
  </description>
